NAME
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets views - manage View resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets views COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage View resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Describe views.

     list
        (BETA) List views.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

